{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38965","headline":"赠彭蠡钓者 · 杜荀鹤","name":"赠彭蠡钓者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偏坐渔舟出苇林，苇花零落向秋深。\n祗将波上鸥爲侣，不把人间事系心。\n傍岸歌来风欲起，卷丝眠去月初沈。\n若教我似君闲放，赢得湖山到老吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}